{%- comment -%}
  AJ Deal Announcement — the top bar, pointing at whatever today's Yoink is.

  The announcement bar is the most-seen strip on the site and it was saying
  "Welcome to our store", which tells a visitor nothing. On a store whose entire
  proposition is one deal a day, the bar should name that deal and link to it.

  Resolves the live deal itself from the daily_deal metaobject, exactly as the
  homepage section does, so it changes on its own when the deal rotates at 9am.
  Nothing to edit daily.

  Renders NOTHING when no deal is live, rather than announcing a deal that does
  not exist. A fallback message is available for that case if wanted.

  ON CACHING: this is resolved server-side per request. Shopify may serve a
  cached page for a short window around the 9am changeover, so the bar can
  briefly name the outgoing deal. It self-corrects, and the link stays valid
  either way — it points at a real product, just yesterday's.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign now = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
  assign deal = null

  for entry in shop.metaobjects.daily_deal.values
    assign starts = entry.starts_at.value | date: '%s' | plus: 0
    assign ends = entry.ends_at.value | date: '%s' | plus: 0
    if starts <= now and ends > now
      assign deal = entry
      break
    endif
  endfor

  assign product = deal.product.value
  assign variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant

  comment
    Discount against the supplier MSRP where there is one — a genuine list
    price, and the bigger number. Otherwise against our own price.
  endcomment
  assign anchor = variant.compare_at_price
  if anchor == blank or anchor <= variant.price
    assign anchor = null
  endif
  if anchor
    assign saved_percent = anchor | minus: variant.price | times: 100 | divided_by: anchor
  endif
-%}

{%- if product != blank -%}
  <a
    class="aj-announce"
    href="{{ product.url }}"
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    <span class="aj-announce__label">{{ block.settings.label | default: "Today's Yoink" }}</span>
    <span class="aj-announce__title">{{ product.title | escape }}</span>
    {%- if saved_percent -%}
      <span class="aj-announce__save">{{ saved_percent }}% off</span>
    {%- endif -%}
    <span class="aj-announce__go" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
  </a>
{%- elsif block.settings.fallback != blank -%}
  <span class="aj-announce aj-announce--plain" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    {{ block.settings.fallback | escape }}
  </span>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .aj-announce {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .aj-announce:hover .aj-announce__title,
  .aj-announce:focus-visible .aj-announce__title {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .aj-announce__label {
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .aj-announce__title {
    /* One line in the bar. The product page carries the full name. */
    max-width: 22rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .aj-announce__save {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .aj-announce__go {
    transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .aj-announce:hover .aj-announce__go {
    transform: translateX(2px);
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    /* The title is the least useful part on a narrow bar — the label and the
       saving already say "there is a deal, tap here". */
    .aj-announce__title { max-width: 11rem; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .aj-announce__go { transition: none; }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "AJ Deal Announcement",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Names today's Yoink and links to it. Updates on its own when the deal rotates; hidden when no deal is running."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "label",
      "label": "Label",
      "default": "Today's Yoink"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "fallback",
      "label": "When no deal is running",
      "default": "",
      "info": "Leave empty to show nothing at all rather than announce a deal that is not there."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "AJ Deal Announcement"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
